Changes made:
- Added CSS rule in custom-additions.css to make the video 30% smaller while maintaining aspect ratio
- The video has class "video-portrait" and is inside a div with class "device-mockup laptop"
- Added the following CSS rule to custom-additions.css:
  ```css
